}
"T3DWindowTitle" "Carlos T. Sanchez - Maintainance Crew 2"
"T3DMessageText" "02:23 The door to the landing bay is blocked and we can't proceed any further. We decided to descend through those coolant pipes to the lower level and then head south. We can hear disturbing noises coming from down there, but there's no way back. We drew straws... Vincent will go first."
"T3DMessageText2" "02:29 No sign from Vincent! I'm not sure, but i think i heard a scream coming through the pipes... Jesus, if i'd only know for sure it wasn't only my imagination."
"T3DMessageText3" "02:47 Still no sign. I don't know what's worse: the noises coming from outside or the silence from below."
"T3DMessageText4" "03:16 Can't wait here any longer. Something's trying to get inside through the door. I'm going down."
"T3DButtonOutputStatus" "NO_SOURCE_EVENT"
"T3DButtonMatchedRecipients" "0"
"T3DButtonConnectionsWritten" "0"
"T3DPanelModelMappingStatus" "SOURCE_MODEL_UNAVAILABLE_PANEL_PROP_NOT_GUESSED"
"T3DDrawScale" "0.800000"
}

